{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "57298982-fd71-48b8-904e-d761a3d04797",
    "name": "Service Discovery",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "Internal control-plane collection for the accepted CPR contract. SD has no Gateway slug or client port. Run read-only/negative checks from the private service network. Mutation/failure-injection tests skip unless sdRunLifecycle=true and a fresh isolated battle fixture is configured; never use a real service instance ID. No actual Telegram message is sent or verified here. Fault reports are synthetic API tests, not proof of actual Gateway breaker integration."
  },
